OL,3,A'Honeymoon at Gatwick': Passengers
OL,4,Adescribe airport chaos as No 10 backs
OL,5,Aair traffic control boss
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of thousands of people are
OL,8,Fthought to have been affected by flight
OL,9,Fcancellations and delays, caused by a
OL,10,Ftechnical problem at air traffic
OL,11,Fcontrol on Tuesday
OL,13,FImages show passengers sleeping on
OL,14,Fairport floors, with aviation analytics
OL,15,Ffirm Cirium saying more than 300
OL,16,Fflights were cancelled today - around
OL,17,F5% of the total
OL,19,FThat's down on Tuesday, when around 30%
OL,20,Fof flights were cancelled or did not
OL,21,Ffly
